.	http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/ecce:annotation		ECCE-QM, B3LYP-D3(BJ)/def2-TZVP, optimisation and frequencies. This calculation shows a sodium ion held at the oxygen end of a water molecule: on a Density Profile line from Na to O the density between them falls to a low minimum, far below that of a covalent bond.
